        },
        "9927e90d-2ecb-4104-af67-0dadf75b2a0a": {
          "type": "product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Use Guide - Side Table Crate",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<p>The Koozi Side Table Crate seamlessly combines style and functionality, making it a perfect addition to any room. Use it as a sleek side table beside your sofa or bed, while your dog enjoys it as a cozy den nearby.</p><p>For dogs or puppies new to crates, we recommend a gradual introduction and close monitoring of their behaviour. Do not leave them unattended if they show signs of being destructive; any damage caused by dogs is not covered by warranty.</p><p>We advocate for <strong>responsible</strong> crate training practices. Never leave your dog in the crate with the door closed if they appear distressed, and avoid long, extended periods inside. Remember, dog crates are not designed to be cages; they should provide a safe retreat for your furry friend. For more information and helpful tips, please refer to our recommended crate training guides available on our blog.</p><p>Do not put the crate directly in the sun - this is not good for your dog nor the crate. Find a shady spot in your home.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
