    "section_text_FKmVDD": {
      "type": "section-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_V8DVMP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Flat-out Comfort: The Plushest Sleep for Dogs who Love to Stretch Out</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_KX4Y44": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The <strong>Plush Bed</strong> features a full flat design, allowing your dog to stretch out in their instinctual sleeping position. Made from high-quality memory foam it helps minimise joint pressure, and has a sleek, minimalist look to complement your home. It fits perfectly inside the <strong>Koozi Side Table Dog Crate</strong>. </p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_V8DVMP",
        "text_KX4Y44"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_position": "center",
        "bg_color_secondary": false,
        "text_color": "text-dark",
        "width": "wrapper--narrow",
        "padding_top": 90,
        "padding_bottom": 34
      }
    },
    "section_columns_8Tj7BM": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_eFHgUN": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/flat_bed_boucle.jpg",
            "title": "Orthopaedic Memory Foam - with Cooling Gel",
            "text": "<p>Our foam is <a href=\"http://www.certipur.us/\" title=\"CertiPUR-US®\">CertiPUR-US®</a> certified, providing orthopaedic support that's just the right balance for smaller dogs. Topped with a cooling gel memory foam for a breathable, temperature regulating and contouring layer for ultimate comfort.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_qaLj9n": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Plush_Flat_Beds_Stacked.jpg",
            "title": "Premium Upholstery Fabric Covers",
            "text": "<p>We thoughtfully select fabrics that combine timeless style, durability, and easy maintenance. Our linen covers are breathable and come in five natural earthy tones, seamlessly blending into any home decor. For a softer, cosier feel, our boucle fabric offers a rich, plush texture in a warm, buttery hue.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_wAcDzT": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Red_Clay_linen_Plush_Flat_Bed_-_straight_on.jpg",
            "title": "Minimalist and Low-profile Mattress Perfect for Smaller Dogs",
            "text": "<p>The low-profile mattress design makes it easy for smaller dogs to hop on and off. It's sleek, soft and supportive, ensuring comfort without the unnecessary height.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_VY7JrM": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Light_khaki_plush_flat_linen_bed.jpg",
            "title": "Rounded Corners Style and Reduce Chewing",
            "text": "<p>The rounded corners deliver a sleek, refined look that also may help to deter chewing - as dogs are generally less tempted by rounded edges than sharp corners.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_PCHy8M": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/flatbed3sizes_khaki_red_oatmeal.jpg",
            "title": "Machine Washable Bed Covers",
            "text": "<p>Our fabric covers are zip-removable and can be machine washed on a gentle low-temperature cycle, for easy care. Foam can be spot-cleaned.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_XmfGhT": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cloudbed_zip_c59d3fe0-1f27-4640-94b5-92677fd19494.jpg",
            "title": "Waterproof Liner and Non-skid Base",
            "text": "<p>Protected from spills with a waterproof liner. These features also prevents sliding, reduces the risk of spills, and provides extra stability for your dog - especially on smooth surfaces.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        }
      },
