    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the Koozi Side Table Dog rate?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Simple Self Guided Assembly<br/></strong>The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate arrives flat-packed and can be assembled in under 15 minutes using our clear instructions.<br/><br/><strong>Video-Assisted Assembly<br/></strong>Enjoy free, real-time video assembly support with one of our friendly team members. We’ll guide you through the simple steps to set up your Koozi Side Table Dog Crate. Once your order is dispatched, our team will contact you to schedule a convenient time for the assembly.</p><p><strong>White Glove Delivery & Assembly </strong></p><ul><li><strong>Greater Sydney / Hunter / Illawarra Region Only</strong>: Enjoy free white glove delivery and assembly. Our team will reach out to schedule delivery and assemble the crate in your preferred room. Alternatively, assembly support is available via video call.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<h6>Warranty Coverage</h6><p>Koozi Pets provides a <strong>12-month limited warranty</strong> covering manufacturing defects only. This warranty applies solely to defects from faulty workmanship.<br/><br/>The warranty period for Side Table Dog Crates purchased from Koozi is one (1) year from the date of purchase. If a replacement Side Table Dog Crate or part is provided, it will inherit the remaining warranty of the original item or one year from the replacement date.</p><p>During the warranty period, Koozi Pets will replace any products or parts of the Side Table Dog Crate that are proven to be defective due to improper material or workmanship, only. Repairs and/or replacements are provided at no charge to you, for eligible warranty claims.<br/><br/>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover:</p><ul><li><strong>Damage caused by improper assembly </strong>or not following the instructions when unpacking.</li><li><strong>Normal wear and tear</strong>, including any dog-related use, washing-related wear, weathering, sun-damage or corrosion.</li><li><strong>Damages due to use by pets</strong> (e.g., chewing, bites, rips, burns, excessive scratching, stains, or moisture/liquid damage).</li><li><strong>Damage from improper weight placement</strong> on the Side Table Crate.</li><li><strong>Scars, marks and colour</strong> that are characteristics of natural materials.</li><li><strong>Damage caused by spills </strong>such as acid, solvents, dyes or other corrosive materials, ink, paint, or bodily fluids.</li><li><strong>Commercial use</strong> damage, such as use in hotels or stores.</li></ul><p><br/>To make a claim please read our policy and steps to submit a claim <a href=\"https://koozipets.com.au/pages/warranty-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty & Returns\">here</a>.</p><h6>Returns and Exchanges Policy</h6><p><strong>We do not offer returns or exchanges</strong> on the Side Table Crate, including for change of mind, as it is a<em> large furniture item</em> and cannot be returned once shipped to you. There is no way of you shipping it back to us.<br/><br/>Before purchasing, please ensure the Side Table Crate meets your dog’s size and has that you have an adequate space in your home to fit it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_PWTFw6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the right size for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend referring to our <a href=\"/pages/size-guide-side-table-crate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Size Guide - Side Table Crate\">size guide </a>at the top of the page, to ensure you choose the right size for your dog.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xJFRkJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of crate training?",
            "text": "<p>Crate training can help dogs feel secure and comfortable by providing a personal, safe space that reduces anxiety and fosters a sense of routine, especially overnight. This practice is particularly beneficial during a puppy's early months and years, supporting their learning and growth, but it also serves as a practical and cherished retreat for dogs of all ages. The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate continues to serve as a dedicated safe den for sleep and relaxation throughout your dog's life.</p><p>With the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate, you can offer this essential comfort without the eyesore of traditional crates. Instead, it serves as a stylish statement piece that enhances your home decor.</p><p>Recognising that crate training is a personal choice that varies based on your dog's needs, our crate features a hidden pocket door system. This innovative design allows it to function as both a cosy den with the door up and a chic side table for your living space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>How can I contact DIGGS Care Team for further assistance?</p><p>For any additional questions or concerns, you can reach out to the DIGGS Care Team. For the fastest response, text us at +1 (833) 802-0537 or email help@diggs.pet. Our Care Team is available from 9am-5pm ET, seven days a week.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate suitable for puppies?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the Koozi Side Table Crate is ideal for introducing your puppy to their own dedicated safe and cosy resting space while seamlessly integrating into your living spaces. Its durable design ensures it lasts a lifetime, beautifully complementing your home as your puppy grows.</p><p>The interior is built to withstand light scratching and is waterproof. However, we understand that accidents may happen during the toilet training phase. While our Plush Bed is waterproof and thick enough to protect the crate, we recommend placing a dedicated towel on the base of the crate beneath the bed for added protection of the wooden base. This precaution can help minimise hygiene concerns, staining, and odour issues from any toilet accidents.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_tgg4bt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate different to other crates?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Dual Functionality</strong>: Unlike standard crates, the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate serves a dual purpose as a stylish side table and a functional dog den. This allows it to seamlessly blend into your home decor while providing a cosy, safe space for your pet.</p><p><strong>Design Aesthetic</strong>: The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate is designed to be visually appealing, ensuring that it complements your interior design rather than detracting from it, unlike the eyesore of metal wire crates. This modern approach to pet furniture enhances the overall look of your pet-friendly living spaces.</p><p><strong>Versatile Use</strong>: With the option to leave the door open for a safe den or closed for crate training, it offers flexibility in how you use the Side Table Dog Crate, adapting to your dog's needs.</p><p><strong>Quality Furniture Materials</strong>: Crafted with premium materials, including a durable construction that’s built to last, the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate is both functional and stylish, setting it apart from lower-quality metal alternatives.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_kQ7jeG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order be delivered?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Delivery Timeframe</strong><br/>We ship from our warehouse in Sydney, with orders dispatching within 1 to 2 business days. <br/><br/>Delivery timeframe is typically between 2 - 10 business days, depending on your location in Australia.<br/><br/><strong>Complimentary Delivery on All Orders: </strong>For a limited time, enjoy free standard shipping on all purchases. </p><p>You will receive an order confirmation email once your order has been dispatched, along with a tracking link to monitor its progress.</p><p><strong>Complimentary White Glove Delivery & Assembly Support</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Greater Sydney / Hunter / Illawarra Region</strong>: Enjoy free white glove delivery and assembly. Our team will reach out to schedule delivery and assemble the crate in your preferred room. Alternatively, assembly support is available via video call.</li><li><strong>Interstate Customers</strong>: Fast free delivery<em> (for a limited time) </em> Australia-wide with assembly support available via video call, guiding you through the setup process at your convenience.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "text_VQ93ck": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What accessories are compatible with the Koozi Side Table Crate?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Plush Bed:</strong> Our Plush Bed is designed to fit perfectly into the Koozi Side Table Crate. Available in luxurious linen and boucle fabric covers, its colours and shape complement the minimalist, modern, and organic style of the crate. This thoughtful design ensures that both you and your beloved dog can enjoy your Koozi moments together in comfort and style.</p><p><strong>Sofa Toppers:</strong> The Sofa Topper is a versatile accessory designed to enhance your dog’s comfort in multiple settings. Use it as an additional layer of cosiness inside the Koozi Side Table Crate, or place it on the sofa next to your crate for easy access during cuddle time. You can even drape it over the end of your bed, ensuring that protection and added texture are always within reach. This stylish topper is perfect for moving around and can be used on various soft furnishings, making it a practical and chic addition to your home.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
